{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"862869435940339732","name":"grassy-bay-bleed🏝🛶","position":86,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"The estuary-bay occupying the southeast coast of Ferrytown is home to large swaths of coastal feywild parks, many of which are islands. These parks are frequently used by smugglers to avoid watchful eyes, as it is exceedingly difficult to track a shipment that passes in and out of the feywild. The large swath near spitside is home to a large orchard.","type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They chuckle. \"I'm glad you understand. Can't wait for this whole thing to be over so i'm allowed to just talk to people about stuff. Anyways, I'd like to poke a bit at your perceptions and assumptions. Who or what exactly do you believe I represent?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:10:16.535000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868057419496976386","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Um. I'm gonna go out on a limb here and say... Empire City? Going out on what I know since you were there with us when the giant squid was in trouble. You're at least concerned about what happens to this city.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:13:31.519000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868058237319131156","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They extend a hand and shake it in a 'so-so' gesture. \"More or less. That's really more of my official title, tonight i'm more specifically representing the rebellion.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:15:22.031000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868058700840075275","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Rebellion. Empire City. You think about it hard enough, they'd be the same. Otherwise, the redcoats wouldn't have tried to tear it down.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:17:30.478000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868059239585824778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They tap the side of their nose. \"I like the way you think. Now then, do you have any questions you need addressed before we begin proper?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:18:30.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868059489482469397","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Not really. I'm at least mostly certain I'm not going to get killed here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:20:50.702000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868060079386144798","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They chuckle. \"It's not 100% out of the question, but i think you have a good chance of surviving.\" They slide their hand over to you and a mug full of a fizzy drink appears in it. \"Take a drink, if you would\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:22:11.988000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868060420324347945","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"There's my questions. I'm not gonna willy-nilly accept a drink from a fey without asking a few. What does this drink do?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:24:15.304000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868060937549148201","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Compells you to tell the truth. No other effects, no inherent promise tied to the drink, just a guarantee of honest answers from you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:25:22.035000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868061217439219712","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Well, alright then.\" Satisfied with that answer, Irynx drinks it down.","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:26:11.601000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868061425334095904","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"It tastes warm and fizzy. You are unable to lie to Prosser for the next hour.","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:27:08.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868061663667060797","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Thank you very much. Now then, since we first encountered each other you've had quite the change. Do you have any other personas or aliases besides Seraxa or Irynx?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:28:27.721000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868061996262776872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"No. I've only ever been one or the other.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:29:21.031000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868062219861127178","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They nod. \"Do you, or have you ever, worked for the British Crown? If so, when and what position did you hold?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:29:58.621000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T09:30:25.479000Z","id":"868062377524998194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Not to my knowledge. I... freelance, so to speak, but haven't yet for the British -- and likely won't ever.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:32:29.239000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868063009262698536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Understood. In brief, what are your thouhts on the current british occupation of portions of Arcania and the crown in general?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:33:42.704000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T09:33:49.541000Z","id":"868063317397217290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"I tolerated them up until they confiscated my shit and then bombed the city down to a secret tenth hell. Also they just have really oppressive rules and they suck.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:39:23.948000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868064748678307841","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"That they do, that they do. One final question: Are you willing to go to great and dangerous lengths to protect the innocent, fight opression, and end the occupation?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:40:38.051000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868065059488825394","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Short answer, yes. Long answer, as long as they don't interfere with my other duties. I have a pact with the ravens of Kingsbridge.\" She moves her hair behind her shoulders to reveal the tattoo on her neck and chest. \"There's definitely a lot of overlap, at least. *Great and dangerous lengths to protect the innocent* is just more words to describe their tenets.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:46:21.359000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868066499426926603","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They nod. \"That is acceptable. People often see the noir and fey bleeds as opposite, but they are merely reflections through different lenses.\" Prosser smiles and begins to row the boat further onward, until you are further lost.","created_at":"2021-07-23T09:49:10.468000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868067208721481748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Irynx returns on a rowboat, after getting lost for some time. \"Hoo boy.\" She gets off and walks to <#852731936349880390>","created_at":"2021-07-23T11:15:17.476000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868088880723816498","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Prosser rows through a maze of islands, dipping in and out of bleeds until you are thouroughly lost. They look to you. \"So, I take it you weren't entirely turned off by the invitation?\" they have a small smile.","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:07:38.250000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868207750545567745","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"I appreciate a little privacy and figured the best way to ensure it was hear you out.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:08:23.183000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T19:08:33.832000Z","id":"868207939008200734","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"What is it you want of me, Prosser?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:09:01.521000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868208099809439754","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Did my father send you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:09:10.309000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868208136668983346","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
