{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"“Who doesn’t?” He chuckles","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:20:13.800000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868210919551938602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"“My friends in school used to call me all sorts of crazy nicknames.”","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:21:35.034000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868211260272050186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"“For a period of time, I dated a lass, used to call me CareBear.”","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:23:58.161000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868211860590178394","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Prosser chuckles. \"I see. Next, do you or have you ever worked for the british crown? If so, for what purpose and when?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:25:27.318000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868212234541756476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"“Never the crown exactly but my family has dealings with certain nobility that have a vested interest in subverting the monarchy.","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:26:43.127000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868212552507752459","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"“Inside men and women as it were.”","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:27:02.524000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868212633864654948","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
